"""Score endpoint sequences against a public human Tn5 PWM.

The endpoint BED windows are 41 bp, with the observed BED boundary at
relative sequence position zero.  Start windows are in genomic orientation;
end windows were reverse-complemented by bedtools.  The PWM's tenth row is
the insertion-centered row, so the best motif-start offset identifies the
insertion offset from each observed boundary.
"""

